---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo run validate])

    Sources{Profile and dataset sources valid?}
    Parse{Profile and dataset schemas valid?}
    Executable{Profile executable for dataset?}
    Payload[Build validation payload]

    Success([Success response])

    SourceFail([Input source error])
    ParseFail([Input schema error])
    ExecutabilityFail([Executability validation error])
    OutputFail([Output write error])

    Start --> Sources

    Sources -- No --> SourceFail
    Sources -- Yes --> Parse

    Parse -- No --> ParseFail
    Parse -- Yes --> Executable

    Executable -- No --> ExecutabilityFail
    Executable -- Yes --> Payload

    Payload --> Success
    Payload -. Write fails .-> OutputFail

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class Sources,Parse,Executable,Payload system
    class SourceFail,ParseFail,ExecutabilityFail,OutputFail error
